WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.120
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain an episode called “Mother's Remote”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:15.920
from a Sci-fi drama anthology “On Children.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:23.440
Chen Shu-Li is a middle-aged woman who has&nbsp;
recently been divorced from her husband.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:29.440
They have a teenage son together named Pei-Wei.&nbsp;
Shu-Li is overly obsessed with her kid and wants&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:35.600
him all to herself. She has even managed to get&nbsp;
the sole custody of Pei-Wei. The mother and son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:41.840
have recently moved into their new home. A worker&nbsp;
helps Shu-Li carry all the boxes. His footsteps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.600
seem to disgust her, so as soon as the guy leaves,&nbsp;
she starts to mop the floor. Shu-Li is an extreme&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:53.120
germaphobe who is obsessed with sanitation and&nbsp;
feels compelled to clean excessively. While&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:59.200
dusting Pei-Wei’s room, she finds several boxes&nbsp;
under his bed. She brings a suspicious one out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.520
and finds the school’s stamp on it. 
She realizes that her son has been using&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.320
them to create fake test results to&nbsp;
hide his grades from her. In school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:13.360
Pei-Wei is with his friends talking about the&nbsp;
upcoming graduation trip. They have planned to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.400
sneak out of the hotel room to go for a bike&nbsp;
ride. As they excitedly discuss the plan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:24.560
a female classmate approaches them and asks for a&nbsp;
Pei-Wei’s friend’s jacket. They laugh and hand it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:30.480
to her, sensing a romantic relationship forming&nbsp;
between them. She gives him a note asking him out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:36.160
on a date, making the guys playfully tease him.
Before returning home, Pei-Wei prints out a copy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:41.280
of his fake report card. He plans to use the&nbsp;
stamps at home to make the card look authentic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:45.840
Pei-Wei knows that if his mother finds out&nbsp;
about his shenanigan, she will never allow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:51.120
him to go on the graduation trip, still, he&nbsp;
takes the chance. When he reaches home, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:56.400
looks for the box but cannot find it. He pretends&nbsp;
to be studying when his mother enters the room.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:00.800
He sees that she has the box with her.&nbsp;
A nervous Pei-Wei doesn’t say a word,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:07.040
knowing that his secret is out. She starts to&nbsp;
scold him but he ignores her entirely. Shu-Li is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:13.040
enraged at his behavior and gets ever more furious&nbsp;
when he says he lost his actual report card. 
&nbsp;

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:18.880
Pei-Wei is interested in painting and doodling&nbsp;
but she doesn’t support his hobbies. In contrast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:24.160
she blames his doodles for his low grades and&nbsp;
refuses to let him go on the graduation trip.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.960
In a fit of rage, Pei-Wei says that his&nbsp;
father would have let him go. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:34.960
Shu-Li quietly leaves him alone. She works till&nbsp;
midnight to calm her anger, then knocks on his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:39.520
door again. When he doesn’t answer she goes&nbsp;
to a convenience store to get a cigarette.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:44.640
While smoking at the bus stop, Shu-Li notices&nbsp;
an advertisement playing on a screen nearby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:50.320
The actor questions the viewers if their children&nbsp;
are disobedient. This catches Shu-Li’s attention,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.000
making her listen carefully. 
Using the latest technology,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.760
scientists have created a remote that&nbsp;
will help parents make their children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:03.200
do anything they want. They can basically make all&nbsp;
the decisions for the kids without them rebelling.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.480
The advertisement, however, doesn’t explain&nbsp;
what exactly the product is. Moments later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:14.160
a man approaches Shu-Li who she recognizes as the&nbsp;
person from the advertisement she just watched. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:25.120
asks her if she is interested in the device. The&nbsp;
following morning, Pei-Wei wakes up late and runs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:30.720
to the door after getting ready. On his way to the&nbsp;
bus stop, he bumps into a man and apologizes. 
&nbsp;

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:36.640
Because of this, he misses the bus and has to take&nbsp;
a taxi. When the taxi driver states his son also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:42.960
reads in the same school, he realizes something is&nbsp;
odd. Pei-Wei is experiencing some kind of Deja Vu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:47.360
because he went through the same experience&nbsp;
the previous morning. When he reaches school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:52.480
everyone is already in the class. He joins his&nbsp;
group of friends and asks them what day it is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:57.920
They reply that it is June, 7th, Wednesday.&nbsp;
Pei-Wei clearly remembers that it was yesterday&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:02.000
which freaks him out even more. 
During break time, they yet again plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.600
to sneak out of their hotel room on the graduation&nbsp;
trip. Similarly, a girl approaches them asking for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:13.920
Pei-Wei’s friend’s jacket. Not understanding what&nbsp;
is going on, Pei-Wei chooses to stay quiet. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:19.840
a long confusing day when he returns home, he sees&nbsp;
that his box of stamps is still under his bed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:23.680
Pei-Wei is confused but he doesn’t want&nbsp;
to risk his mother getting mad again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:28.720
He stamps the fake report card and shows&nbsp;
it to his mother who appears disappointed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:34.000
She doesn’t call him out for lying and simply asks&nbsp;
him to have his dinner. The following day, Pei-Wei&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:39.520
is again late for school. He gets ready and runs&nbsp;
to the bus stop only to bump into the same guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:45.040
for the third time. When he misses his bus and&nbsp;
gets into the exact taxi as the previous day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:54.800
he registers he might be stuck in a loop. 
He runs to the school and looks at the date which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.800 --> 00:05:00.160
still happens to be the seventh of June. After&nbsp;
school, he shows his mother the fake card yet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:05.520
again. However, this time, she doesn't accept it.&nbsp;
She claims that she had given him three chances to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:11.120
redeem himself but he hasn’t learned a lesson.&nbsp;
A shocked Pei-Wei looks at her in disbelief as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:16.880
Shu-Li declares if he doesn’t fix his mistake, he&nbsp;
will be stuck in the loop forever. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:22.640
she brings out a strange remote and presses the&nbsp;
reset button. This turns back time for Pei-Wei,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:27.120
making him wake up on the 7th of June for&nbsp;
the fourth time. The remote is a controlling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:31.120
device she bought from the stranger at&nbsp;
the bus stop. It is used as a torturing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.920
technique to make one’s child obedient. 
Pei-Wei wakes up and confronts his mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:42.000
but gets no reply. She asks him to make the right&nbsp;
decision and not disappoint her this time. Still,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:52.000
Pei-Wei does the same. For the next few days, the&nbsp;
loop keeps on repeating. When Pei-Wei finally gets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:57.040
tired of it, he hands her his real report card to&nbsp;
his mother. Delighted at her first success, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:02.800
instantly puts forward another obstacle for him.&nbsp;
Shu-Li knows he hates bitter gourd, so to test&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:08.800
his obedience, she makes him eat it for dinner.&nbsp;
Fearing the remote, he does as told. Furthermore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:14.240
she demands he go to cram school starting the next&nbsp;
day. This means that Pei-Wei won’t get to meet his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:20.160
friends anymore, still, he cannot refuse. To make&nbsp;
him the best in his class, she plans to repeat a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:26.640
day fifteen times. That way, he can learn the same&nbsp;
chapter fifteen times while his friends only do it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:32.240
once. On his first day of Cram school, she makes&nbsp;
him wear the clothes of her choice. For the next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:37.840
fifteen days, he continues going to the “first”&nbsp;
day of class. Pei-Wei hardly has any control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:43.680
in his life, his only way to survive is to do as&nbsp;
told. The loops make him suffocate but his mother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:54.720
is too obsessive to understand his sufferings. 
One day after class, he goes to the school&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:59.600
and meets his homeroom teacher. When Pei-Wei&nbsp;
insists, the teacher agrees to try to persuade&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:04.560
his mother to let him go on the graduation trip.&nbsp;
He arranges a meeting with her and puts forward&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:09.280
his concerns about Pei-Wei’s mental health&nbsp;
but Shu-Li is adamant about her decision.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:13.120
She thinks she knows the best for her kid&nbsp;
and completely ignores the teacher’s pleas.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:19.680
One day, Pei-Wei is in the library when he meets&nbsp;
a girl named Cheng Fang-Lan. She also likes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:24.800
doodle, so the two instantly get along. They&nbsp;
talk about several doodle artists and promise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:30.480
to meet again the next day before separating. 
After some days of talking, Pei-Wei skips his cram&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:36.400
class and goes to Fang-Lan’s home for a date. He&nbsp;
is welcomed by her painter mother and musician&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:42.000
father. They are the exact opposite of Shu-Li&nbsp;
which is refreshing for Pei-Wei. The kids go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:47.680
to the terrace and paint using water guns.&nbsp;
This is the most fun Pei-Wei has ever had.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:52.960
As they talk about their dreams and aspirations,&nbsp;
Fang-Lan says that she wants to go to New York to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:59.680
study arts. The next day, Shu-Li gets a call from&nbsp;
Pei-Wei’s teacher who informs her of his absence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:05.120
Somewhere else, he and Fang-Lan are enjoying&nbsp;
their date. They go to a photo booth and kiss.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:10.640
But their date is interrupted by Shu-Li who has&nbsp;
found them after tracking Pei-Wei’s phone. 
&nbsp;

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:15.120
She takes them out for lunch and asks&nbsp;
Fang-Lan several questions about herself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.120 --> 00:08:19.920
When they return home in the evening, she&nbsp;
demands Pei-Wei to stop going to the library&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:25.840
and stop seeing Fang-Lan immediately. Pei-Wei&nbsp;
begs her to let him have this one thing but she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:30.960
stays put in her decision. Seeing him desperate&nbsp;
for something that she doesn’t like, she uses a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:36.480
special feature in the remote and resets the&nbsp;
loop. Pei-Wei wakes up in his bed and runs to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:42.560
meet Fang-Lan but she doesn’t recognize him. He&nbsp;
is devastated to find that because of the remote,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:48.080
no one except for his mother recognizes him.&nbsp;
Following that day, Pei-Wei gets extremely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:54.880
sick and can hardly get up. Shu-Li takes care&nbsp;
of him to her best but he only gets weaker. 
&nbsp;

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:59.360
He often dreams of playing with her&nbsp;
friends and Fang-Lan on a beach but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:04.080
knows his dream will never come true. 
The scene shifts to several years later.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:10.400
Pei-Wei has grown into a man with a stable job&nbsp;
and high income. He is dating a girl named Zhi-Zhi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:16.000
and has moved from his mother’s house. Shu-Li,&nbsp;
however, is still very involved in his life and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:20.880
controls him to some point. Her obsession&nbsp;
with cleanliness has passed onto Pei-Wei.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:26.480
Shu-Li doesn’t approve of Zhi-Zhi so she is&nbsp;
constantly looking for girls to set him up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:31.360
One evening, they meet for dinner where she&nbsp;
has invited one of such girls named Riley.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:36.400
According to Shu-Li, Riley has recently returned&nbsp;
from America and is looking for a partner. 
&nbsp;

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:42.480
She tries to engage Pei-Wei in a conversation&nbsp;
with Riley but he clearly isn’t interested. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:47.440
dinner, the two are left alone. Riley tells&nbsp;
him that she is actually engaged to a girl.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:51.840
Her parents do not support her decision and&nbsp;
trick her into joining people for dinner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:57.040
like she did today. Pei-Wei laughs and reveals&nbsp;
that he also has a girlfriend and didn’t know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:01.920
she would be here tonight. They talk about her&nbsp;
life in America. When Riley mentions New York,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:07.600
Pei-Wei reminisces about his first love; Fang-Lan.&nbsp;
He remembers all the time he spent with her like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:12.160
it was yesterday and still despises his&nbsp;
mother for doing what she did to him. 
&nbsp;

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:16.800
After returning home that day, he looks for&nbsp;
Fang-Lan’s name on the internet and finds out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:22.080
she is an artist in New York. Seeing her face&nbsp;
makes him tear up thinking about all the things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:26.800
he missed in his childhood. The very next&nbsp;
day, he books his mother a flight to Europe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:31.680
for a vacation. Zhi-Zhi also leaves for&nbsp;
a trip to Australia. When he is alone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:36.160
he goes to Shu-Li’s house to look for the&nbsp;
remote. However, he doesn’t know the safe’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:41.680
passcode. On her way to the airport, Shu-Li&nbsp;
realizes she has left her passport at home. 
&nbsp;

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:47.200
When she returns, she finds her son outside her&nbsp;
house with the remote that she used to control&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:52.000
him. She furiously asks him what he plans&nbsp;
to do with it. Pei-Wei approaches her with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:58.000
the remote but is hit by a vehicle mid-way. The&nbsp;
scene abruptly cuts to the day he met Fang-Lan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:04.640
for the first time. She looks at him and smiles&nbsp;
while Pei-Wei cries, overwhelmed to see her after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:09.920
so long. We can assume that after Pei-Wei was&nbsp;
hit by the vehicle, Shu-Li revived him using&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:14.720
the remote. Many fans believe since the remote&nbsp;
hadn’t been used for a long time, it was still&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:20.720
set on the date when Pei-Wei met Fang-Lan. Hence,&nbsp;
when Shu-Li hurriedly pressed it to save her son,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.120
she accidentally sent him to the past. 
